  "body": "**Tier:** T4 (money path). **Why:** free trials with a card up front: the one-trial ledger decides who gets a trial and the trial-ending notice states what the card will be charged. Since fix round 12 the ledger is the one shared trial rule for package trials and main's native subscription trials (one free trial per client per coach, any kind). **T4 trigger scan:** money (Stripe trial subscriptions, charge copy), privacy (notice and ledger logs carry ids and closed codes only). **T3 trigger scan:** schema + migrations (T1), cron worker and outbound push/email (T2), Stripe webhooks (T3). **Bounded T1:** none. **Canonical builder:** agent 115 (split of #656); fix round 6 by B-T12-116 (agent 116); fix round 7 by B-TR-117 (agent 117); fix round 8 by B-TR2-117 (agent 117); fix round 9 by B-TR3-118 (agent 118); fix round 10 by B-TR4-119 (agent 119); fix round 11 by B-TR5-119 (agent 119); fix round 12 (ONE SHARED TRIAL RULE integration) by B-TR8-120 (agent 120); restack by B-TR9-121 (agent 121). **Parent owner:** #656. **Acceptance evidence:** Fix round table below (failing-before and passing-after CI lane runs). **Promotion triggers:** none (already T4).\n\n**Fix round table**\n\n| Round | Piece head | Findings closed | Failing-before | Passing-after |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 6 (restack, merge-only, B-T12-116) | `9719cb88` | none in T3; merges T2 `4fa2fe4a` (delta equals the T2 delta); T3 specs unchanged and green | — | PR CI at `9719cb88` |\n| 7 (restack, merge-only, B-TR-117) | `4ebf2a43` | none in T3; merges T2 `6ce54002` (delta equals the T2 delta byte for byte); T3's composed-create gate now executes | — | PR CI at `4ebf2a43` |\n| 8 (B-TR2-117) | `df76889f` | Opus C-671-4 (trial_ends_at written only for a trial that started); merges T2 `c5e7ed8e` (fix round 8); T3 specs on the T2 round 8 rules ([FIX ROUND 8](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/673#issuecomment-5977778572)) | [run 37185687036](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37185687036) (1 fail) | [run 37185762015](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37185762015) (286/286 + tsc) |\n| 9 (B-TR3-118) | `5fdb5f5c` | Sol B-673-1 (an owed retry reads Stripe first: billed -> superseded, gone -> cancelled, unknown -> retry, cancel only while unbilled) and Sol C-673-2 (fresh lease clock); merges T2 `2690c07c`; B-672-3 regressions for T2 ([FIX ROUND 9](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/673#issuecomment-5982762294)) | [run 37221109080](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37221109080) (12 red) | [run 37221153162](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37221153162) (183/183 + tsc); probes [run 37221217159](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37221217159) |\n| 10 (B-TR4-119) | `904b9642` | Sol B-673-1 (past_due/unpaid decided by a complete paid-invoice page: charged -> superseded, none -> cancel, else retry) and Sol B-673-2 (a supersession, cancellation or lease takeover during the reads vetoes the DELETE); merges T2 `62c2c066`; tests in T4 #706 | [run 37230366374](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37230366374) (20 red) | [run 37231152495](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37231152495) + PR CI at `904b9642` |\n| 11 (B-TR5-119) | `dcf095b8` | Sol B-673-1 narrowed + Opus C-673-6 (a never-billed past_due/unpaid cancel reads the open invoices before the paid list and voids each one, confirmed void inside the lease budget, then re-checks the lease before the DELETE; an unconfirmed void sends no DELETE) and Sol C-673-7 (malformed amounts read unknown); tests in T4 #706 | [run 37236196278](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37236196278) (36 red) | [run 37237173197](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37237173197) (236/236 + tsc); probes [run 37237162635](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37237162635) |\n| 12 (B-TR8-120) | `14b7a7a2` | B-TR7-120 restack stop: main #678 native trials and T3 both owned trial access. ONE SHARED TRIAL RULE (owner 10:31 10-05): main's live subscription authority + `subscriptionGrantsAccess` are the base; every trial start claims the ledger first in the webhook (`trialState`/`trialTransition`, unique (client, coach)); only the holder gets `trial_started_at`; a loser gets no access and owes a cancellation (superseded when it billed). `SubscriptionCheckoutService` registers `TrialCheckoutCapability`. T3 `listPaidInvoices` renamed `listSubscriptionPaidInvoices`, T3 `voidInvoice` dropped for main's keyed one; tests in T4 #706 ([FIX ROUND 12](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/673#issuecomment-6000663552)) | [run 37356010489](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37356010489) (8/8 red) | [run 37355951522](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37355951522) (tsc + 685/692; 7 ruled reds) + PR CI at `14b7a7a2` |\n| restack (B-TR9-121) | `91d0adcb` | none open; merges T2 `193c6f9a` (main `5da537d6`, #661 spent sheet credentials). Conflict `src/checkout/checkout-webhook-handler.service.ts`, 3 hunks: imports (both kept); `applySubscriptionUpdated` and `applyInvoicePaid` data (T3's owner-only `trialStartPatch` + `trial.entitled` kept, main's B-661-14/15 erase kept as is on `entitled`). Added and removed lines identical to `14b7a7a2`; 2,996 lines | — | PR CI at `91d0adcb` |\n\nSplit of #656 (free trials, backend) under the owner's PR size rule: over 3,000 changed lines is an automatic fail (MODEL_ROUTING.md 8.2, tgp-agent-context). #656 was 5,611 lines at `86223987` (FIX ROUND 5). Stack: T1 -> T2 -> T3, merged back to back; deploy only after T3, together with mobile #338. Owner adds the Stripe webhook event `customer.subscription.trial_will_end` before that deploy. The tree at T3 equalled #656 @ 86223987 (checked with git diff) until fix round 6, which adds the T1/T2 fixes. Prior verdicts on #656 (Sol RC 0/4/1 at b9939d02; no full Opus audit) do not carry; each piece needs fresh Opus 5.5 and Sol audits at its exact head (T4, money path). `tsc --noEmit` passes at every piece.\n\n**T3 (base T2, 2,996 lines after fix round 12 and the B-TR9-121 restack; 2,999 after fix round 11; 2,947 after fix round 10; 2,887 after fix round 9; 2,627 after fix round 8; 2,556 before). SIZE ASSESSMENT (over 1,500): one reviewable unit (trial checkout/webhook lifecycle + specs); under the 3,000 hard limit.** trial conflict guard, checkout-webhook handling (trial start, trial_will_end notice delivery, conflict refusal), checkout and billing reads, client purchase select, CheckoutModule wiring, Stripe setup doc, .env.example line, and the notice-and-webhook, fix-round and idempotent-create specs.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
